# Normalise to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This is a static site deployed to a Linux web server, and on Windows git would
# otherwise hand contributors CRLF working copies — which then get uploaded
# verbatim by anyone who deploys with a file copy rather than a checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
